  "extract": "Godfrey Harold Hardy was an English mathematician, known for his achievements in number theory and mathematical analysis. In biology, he is known for the Hardy\u2013Weinberg principle, a basic principle of population genetics.",
  "extract_html": "<p><b>Godfrey Harold Hardy</b> was an English mathematician, known for his achievements in number theory and mathematical analysis. In biology, he is known for the Hardy\u2013Weinberg principle, a basic principle of population genetics.</p>"
